oney-banker-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 407486, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Xu1rt5bQpMy2ZPXfHGLLPm", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 409859, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01EjQ7db89dAqrAnj1J7Zq14", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 410159, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01EjQ7db89dAqrAnj1J7Zq14", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 410159, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EjQ7db89dAqrAnj1J7Zq14", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 413927, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main, with alex as the reviewer. CI passed on the fix.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` rounded with `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring says FIN-212 requires `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (banker's rounding). So `2.665` rounded to `2.67`, but the test expects `2.66`.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`). Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101. Opening the PR didn't add alex as a reviewer, so I requested his review separately, and he's now on it.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the relevant files.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VCcGmmyCZfono369J2k2Cw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}